      "html": "<h2 id=\"tool-description\"><a href=\"#tool-description\"><strong>Tool Description</strong></a></h2>\n<p>The Bloodhound Tool provides support for tracking and intercepting a map item. It allows for the selection of two points on the map, and/or map objects, and displays Range &#x26; Bearing information between the chosen tracker and the target.</p>\n<h2 id=\"instruction-videos\"><a href=\"#instruction-videos\">Instruction videos</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bloodhound-tool-2min\"><a href=\"#bloodhound-tool-2min\">Bloodhound Tool (2min)</a></h3>"
